{"sections":[{"slug":"Fourier--向井变换","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Fourier--向井变换"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Fourier–向井变换”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层的导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层的导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的函子</span> $D(X)\\to D(Y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">它是通过核对象</span> $K\\in D(X\\times Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构造的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">积分变换</span>”.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">许多基本的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆像</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">都具有这种形式</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">向井茂于</span> 1981 <span lang=\"zh\">年最早使用这种变换研究</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel簇","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与其对偶上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层的导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层的导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的等价性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这类似于</span> Fourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换建立了向量空间与其对偶空间上分布的同构</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑代数簇</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $P \\in D^b(X\\times Y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">有函子</span> $\\Phi_P\\colon D^b(X)\\to D^b(Y)$,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal E \\mapsto  p_*(P \\otimes q^*\\mathcal E).\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">省略了所有导出记号</span>.)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">投影映射是平坦的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $q^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">没有导出</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">局部自由</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $p_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">也没有导出</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">恒等</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于对角线层</span> $\\Delta\\colon X\\to X\\times X$, $P=\\mathcal O_\\Delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span> $\\operatorname{id}$.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\t\\Phi_{\\mathcal O_\\Delta}(\\mathcal E) &amp; \\simeq p_*(\\Delta_* \\mathcal O_X \\otimes q^*\\mathcal E)\\\\\r\n\t&amp; \\simeq p_* \\Delta_* (\\Delta^* q^*\\mathcal E \\otimes\\mathcal O_X).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这里使用了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/投影公式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">投影公式</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\nRf_*(\\mathcal F^\\bullet) \\otimes^L \\mathcal E \\simeq Rf_* (\\mathcal F^\\bullet \\otimes^L Lf^*\\mathcal E).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">前推与拉回</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">图像</span>” $\\iota \\colon X\\to X\\times Y$, $\\Gamma_f := \\iota_*\\mathcal O_X$, <span lang=\"zh\">两个方向的</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换分别是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/前推","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>"}},{"Plain":" $f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拉回","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆像</span>"}},{"Plain":" $f^*$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一族连续变化的层</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $P\\in D^b(X\\times Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上凝聚平坦</span> (coherent flat). (<span lang=\"zh\">想象</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为参数</span>, $P_x$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $P_{x_0}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的形变</span>)</p>\n<p>(<span lang=\"zh\">待补充</span>)</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">小平</span>–Spencer <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span></h3>\n<p>(<span lang=\"zh\">待补充</span>)\n$$\r\nT_{x_0}X \\to \\operatorname{Ext}^1(P_{x_0},P_{x_0})\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">注意</span> $T_{x_0}X$ <span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> $\\operatorname{Ext}^1(k(x_0),k(x_0))$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换有左右伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且均为</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $P\\in D^b(X\\times Y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $P_L = P^\\vee \\otimes p^* \\omega_Y[\\dim Y]$ ($p\\colon X\\times Y\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为投影</span>), $P_R = P^\\vee \\otimes q^*\\omega_X [\\dim X] \\in D^b(Y\\times X)$. <span lang=\"zh\">参见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Serre对偶","text":"Serre <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">两个</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换的复合也是</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $P\\in D^b(X\\times Y)$, $Q\\in D^b(Y\\times Z)$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $R\\in D^b(X\\times Z)$ <span lang=\"zh\">如下</span>.\n$$\r\nR = (\\pi_{XZ})_* ((\\pi_{XY})^*P \\otimes (\\pi_{YZ})^* Q).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\pi_{XZ}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X\\times Y\\times Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $X\\times Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">的投影</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">等等</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">如下是</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换是全忠实函子的判定</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是特征</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的代数闭域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的光滑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影簇</span>"}},{"Plain":", $P\\in D^b(X\\times Y)$. Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换</span> $\\Phi$ <span lang=\"zh\">是全忠实函子当且仅当对任意闭点</span> $x,y\\in X$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(\\Phi_P(k(x)),\\Phi_P(k(y))[i])=\r\n\\begin{cases}\r\nk, &amp; x=y,i=0\\\\\r\n0, &amp; x\\neq y\\text{ or }i&lt;0 \\text{ or }i&gt;\\dim X.\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论版本</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathcal F^\\bullet \\in D^b(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/K-群(拓扑)","text":"K-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>)"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的元素</span> $[\\mathcal F^\\bullet]:=\\sum (-1)^i[\\mathcal F^i] \\in K(X)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. $[\\mathcal F^\\bullet] = \\sum (-1)^i [\\mathcal H^i (\\mathcal F^\\bullet)]$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧支集直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧支集直像</span>"}},{"Plain":" $f_! \\mathcal F := \\sum (-1)^i [R^i f_*\\mathcal F]$.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/K-理论","text":"K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">版本的</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换定义如下</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $e\\in K(X\\times Y)$,\n$$\r\n\\Phi^K_e \\colon f\\mapsto p_!(e\\otimes q^* f).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">上同调版本</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $f_*\\colon H^*(X;\\mathbb{Q}) \\to H^{*+2\\dim Y - 2\\dim X}(Y;\\mathbb{Q})$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/投影公式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">投影公式</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nf_*(f^*\\alpha \\cdot \\beta) = \\alpha \\cdot f_*\\beta.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\Phi^H\\colon H^*(X;\\mathbb{Q}) \\to H^*(Y;\\mathbb{Q})$,\n$$\r\n\\Phi^H\\colon \\beta\\mapsto p_*(\\alpha \\cdot q^* \\beta).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈特征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈特征</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是从</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/K-群(拓扑)","text":"K-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>)"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到上同调的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可联系</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论和上同调两个版本的</span> Fouier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井变换</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">两者的关系涉及</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Todd类","text":"Todd <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $e\\in K(X\\times Y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\n\\Phi^H_{v(e)} (\\operatorname{ch}(f)\\sqrt{\\operatorname{td}X}) = \\operatorname{ch}(\\Phi^K_e(f)) \\sqrt{\\operatorname{td}Y}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $v(e) = \\operatorname{ch}(e)\\sqrt{\\operatorname{td}X} \\in H^*(X;\\mathbb{Q})$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> Fourier–<span lang=\"zh\">向井向量</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccccccc}\r\n\tK(X) &amp; \\to &amp; K(X\\times Y) &amp; \\to &amp; K(X\\times Y) &amp; \\to &amp; K(Y)\\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\tH^*(X) &amp; \\to &amp; H^*(X\\times Y) &amp; \\to &amp; H^*(X\\times Y) &amp; \\to &amp; H^*(Y)\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">中间方块交换是由于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}